A	merchant|Merchant Tobin	buyer|Buyer Lysa
L	gate|Town gate	market|Night market
T	failure
Q	escort_merchant	1		0		Escort the Merchant	Walk Tobin to the night market and close the sale before nightfall. He can die on the road, the buyer can leave, or you can turn the job down.
R	escort_pay	currency	coins	40
R	paid_rep	reputation	merchants	10	paid
R	lost_rep	reputation	merchants	-10	merchant_lost
S	meet_merchant	s			talk merchant escort_offer				oqf:escort_offer	0	0	Meet Tobin at the town gate
S	escort		step.meet_merchant	flag.escort_accepted	reach market	kill merchant		0		1	0	Escort Tobin to the night market	Stays available until the job is accepted. Fails if Tobin dies on the road.
S	declined		step.meet_merchant and flag.escort_declined				!declined|Job refused			0	0	Turn the job down
S	merchant_lost		step.escort == "failed"				!merchant_lost|Tobin fell on the road				0	Tobin is gone
S	close_sale		step.escort		talk buyer market_sale	event world.nightfall			oqf:market_sale	1	1	Close the sale before nightfall
S	too_late		step.close_sale == "failed"				!too_late|The buyer left			1	1	The buyer has gone home
S	paid		step.close_sale				paid|Sale closed			1	0	Collect your share
